ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
==================

The TextRuler UserControl in this repository is derived from the following
CodeProject article and is NOT entirely original work by Vader Consulting.

## Original Work

- **Author:** Andrey Lundin
- **Article:** Advanced Text Editor with Ruler
- **URL:** https://www.codeproject.com/Articles/22783/Advanced-Text-Editor-with-Ruler
- **Published:** January 2008
- **Licence:** CodeProject Open Licence (CPOL)

Vader Consulting has modified and repackaged the original TextRuler UserControl
as a standalone NuGet-distributable library. The modifications and packaging
work are original contributions by Vader Consulting, but the core TextRuler
control design originates with Andrey Lundin.

The CodeProject Open Licence (CPOL) applies to the original portions:
https://www.codeproject.com/info/cpol10.aspx